
## 🎨 Propuesta de Front-End: Sección "Impulsa SafeWave"

A continuación te presento el código completo (HTML + CSS + JS) de una sección de donaciones **sin lógica de pago real** (solo UI), con validación de términos y condiciones y selectores de pasarela (PayPal, Stripe, Paynet).

### `donaciones.html`

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Impulsa SafeWave · Donaciones</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --violet-900: #2d1b4e;
      --violet-700: #5b3a8e;
      --violet-500: #8b5cf6;
      --violet-300: #c4b5fd;
      --violet-100: #ede9fe;
      --pink-accent: #ec4899;
      --green-ok: #10b981;
      --gray-900: #1f2937;
      --gray-600: #6b7280;
      --gray-300: #d1d5db;
      --gray-100: #f3f4f6;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --shadow-sm: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
      --shadow-md: 0 8px 24px rgba(91,58,142,.12);
      --shadow-lg: 0 20px 50px rgba(91,58,142,.2);
      --radius: 16px;
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #faf8ff 0%, #f3e8ff 100%);
      color: var(--gray-900);
      line-height: 1.6;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* ===== HEADER ===== */
    .donation-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      animation: fadeInDown .6s ease;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .5rem;
      background: var(--violet-100);
      color: var(--violet-700);
      padding: .5rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: .8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: .05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .badge::before {
      content: '';
      width: 8px; height: 8px;
      background: var(--violet-500);
      border-radius: 50%;
      animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
      50% { opacity: .6; transform: scale(1.3); }
    }

    .donation-header h1 {
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--violet-900);
      margin-bottom: .8rem;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .donation-header h1 span {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--violet-500), var(--pink-accent));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .donation-header p {
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      color: var(--gray-600);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    /* ===== GRID ===== */
    .donation-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
      align-items: start;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .donation-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    /* ===== CARD ===== */
    .card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 2rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      animation: fadeInUp .6s ease;
    }

    .card h2 {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      color: var(--violet-900);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .6rem;
    }

    .card h2 .icon {
      width: 32px; height: 32px;
      background: var(--violet-100);
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    /* ===== MONTOS ===== */
    .amounts {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: .75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 500px) {
      .amounts { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }

    .amount-btn {
      background: var(--gray-100);
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      padding: .9rem .5rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--gray-900);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all .2s ease;
      font-family: inherit;
    }

    .amount-btn:hover { background: var(--violet-100); }

    .amount-btn.active {
      background: var(--violet-100);
      border-color: var(--violet-500);
      color: var(--violet-700);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    .custom-amount {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      background: var(--gray-100);
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: .5rem 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      transition: border-color .2s;
    }

    .custom-amount:focus-within { border-color: var(--violet-500); }

    .custom-amount span {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--gray-600);
      margin-right: .5rem;
    }

    .custom-amount input {
      flex: 1;
      border: none;
      background: transparent;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-family: inherit;
      outline: none;
      padding: .4rem 0;
    }

    /* ===== IMPACTO ===== */
    .impact-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--violet-700), var(--violet-500));
      color: var(--white);
      padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .impact-box .icon-big { font-size: 2rem; }

    .impact-box p { font-size: .92rem; opacity: .95; }

    .impact-box strong { display: block; font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: .2rem; }

    /* ===== MÉTODOS DE PAGO ===== */
    .payment-methods {
      display: grid;
      gap: .8rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
    }

    .payment-option {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
      background: var(--gray-100);
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 12px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all .2s ease;
    }

    .payment-option:hover { background: var(--violet-100); }

    .payment-option.selected {
      background: var(--violet-100);
      border-color: var(--violet-500);
    }

    .payment-option input[type="radio"] { display: none; }

    .payment-logo {
      width: 44px; height: 44px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: .75rem;
      color: var(--white);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .logo-paypal  { background: #003087; }
    .logo-stripe  { background: #635bff; }
    .logo-paynet  { background: #e63946; }
    .logo-spei    { background: var(--green-ok); }

    .payment-info { flex: 1; }
    .payment-info strong { display: block; font-size: .95rem; }
    .payment-info small { color: var(--gray-600); font-size: .8rem; }

    .radio-indicator {
      width: 20px; height: 20px;
      border: 2px solid var(--gray-300);
      border-radius: 50%;
      position: relative;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      transition: all .2s;
    }

    .payment-option.selected .radio-indicator {
      border-color: var(--violet-500);
    }

    .payment-option.selected .radio-indicator::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 3px;
      background: var(--violet-500);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    /* ===== TÉRMINOS ===== */
    .terms {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: .8rem;
      padding: 1rem;
      background: var(--gray-100);
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      font-size: .85rem;
      color: var(--gray-600);
    }

    .terms input[type="checkbox"] {
      appearance: none;
      width: 20px; height: 20px;
      border: 2px solid var(--gray-300);
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 2px;
      transition: all .2s;
      position: relative;
    }

    .terms input[type="checkbox"]:checked {
      background: var(--violet-500);
      border-color: var(--violet-500);
    }

    .terms input[type="checkbox"]:checked::after {
      content: '✓';
      position: absolute;
      color: white;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      top: 50%; left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    }

    .terms a {
      color: var(--violet-700);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: underline;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    /* ===== BOTÓN DONAR ===== */
    .btn-donate {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 1.1rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--violet-700), var(--violet-500));
      color: var(--white);
      border: none;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-family: inherit;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all .3s ease;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: .6rem;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(139,92,246,.35);
    }

    .btn-donate:hover:not(:disabled) {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(139,92,246,.45);
    }

    .btn-donate:disabled {
      opacity: .5;
      cursor: not-allowed;
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    .secure-note {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: .4rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
      font-size: .8rem;
      color: var(--gray-600);
    }

    /* ===== SIDEBAR ===== */
    .sidebar-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1.8rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      animation: fadeInUp .6s ease .1s backwards;
    }

    .sidebar-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--violet-900);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .progress-track {
      background: var(--gray-100);
      border-radius: 999px;
      height: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-bottom: .6rem;
    }

    .progress-fill {
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--violet-500), var(--pink-accent));
      border-radius: 999px;
      width: 0%;
      transition: width 1.5s ease;
    }

    .progress-labels {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: .85rem;
      color: var(--gray-600);
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }

    .progress-labels strong { color: var(--violet-700); }

    .benefits-list {
      list-style: none;
      display: grid;
      gap: .8rem;
    }

    .benefits-list li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: .7rem;
      font-size: .88rem;
      color: var(--gray-600);
    }

    .benefits-list .check {
      width: 20px; height: 20px;
      background: var(--violet-100);
      color: var(--violet-700);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: .7rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    /* ===== MODAL TÉRMINOS ===== */
    .modal-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(45,27,78,.6);
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 1rem;
      z-index: 1000;
    }

    .modal-overlay.active { display: flex; }

    .modal {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      max-width: 560px;
      width: 100%;
      max-height: 85vh;
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: 2rem;
      animation: fadeInUp .3s ease;
    }

    .modal h3 {
      color: var(--violet-900);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }

    .modal-content {
      font-size: .88rem;
      color: var(--gray-600);
      max-height: 45vh;
      overflow-y: auto;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      padding-right: .5rem;
    }

    .modal-content h4 {
      color: var(--violet-700);
      margin: 1rem 0 .4rem;
      font-size: .95rem;
    }

    .modal-content p { margin-bottom: .6rem; }

    .modal-actions { display: flex; gap: .8rem; }

    .btn {
      flex: 1;
      padding: .85rem;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: none;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all .2s;
      font-size: .92rem;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: var(--gray-100);
      color: var(--gray-900);
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--violet-700);
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--violet-500); }

    /* ===== TOAST ===== */
    .toast {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 2rem;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(120px);
      background: var(--violet-900);
      color: var(--white);
      padding: 1rem 1.8rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: .9rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
      transition: transform .4s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);
      z-index: 2000;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .6rem;
      max-width: 90vw;
    }

    .toast.show { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }

    .toast.success { background: var(--green-ok); }
    .toast.error { background: #dc2626; }

    /* ===== ANIMACIONES ===== */
    @keyframes fadeInUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    @keyframes fadeInDown {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-20px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
  <!-- HEADER -->
  <header class="donation-header">
    <div class="badge">Proyecto Escolar · SafeWave</div>
    <h1>Impulsa la <span>Pulsera Women Safety</span></h1>
    <p>Tu donación apoya el desarrollo del prototipo SafeWave: una pulsera con botón de emergencia, GPS y conectividad LoRaWAN que busca proteger a mujeres en situación de riesgo en Hidalgo.</p>
  </header>

  <!-- GRID PRINCIPAL -->
  <div class="donation-grid">
    <!-- COLUMNA IZQUIERDA: FORMULARIO -->
    <section class="card">
      <h2><span class="icon">💜</span> Elige tu aportación</h2>

      <!-- MONTOS RÁPIDOS -->
      <div class="amounts" role="group" aria-label="Montos de donación">
        <button class="amount-btn" data-amount="100">$100</button>
        <button class="amount-btn active" data-amount="250">$250</button>
        <button class="amount-btn" data-amount="500">$500</button>
        <button class="amount-btn" data-amount="1000">$1,000</button>
      </div>

      <!-- MONTO PERSONALIZADO -->
      <div class="custom-amount">
        <span>MXN $</span>
